    "title": "More than half of Stafford High students absent after antisemitic graffiti - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isabel Soisson ,\n4 hours ago FREDERICKSBURG, VA. - More than half of students at Stafford High School were absent Wednesday following concerns over antisemitic and threatening graffiti discovered in student bathrooms earlier this month. According to Stafford County Public Schools, the school’s absentee rate reached 56.9% as students participated in a callout over safety concerns... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
